        "kind": "handwritten",
        "rationale": "Under AON variant 2b the untrusted solver submits the honored subset as a mask and the verifier only ever checks a mask; it never computes one, because the two-cycle book below has no unique maximum honorable subset. Dropping the mask bit while keeping the fill is the leak this refusal exists for. The refusal-only entry point is used deliberately: it is what the crate's own falsifiers use, so the structural refusal is observed rather than masked by the V9 digest comparison that a hand-edited candidate would also fail.",
